name: Operational inspection stays separate from accepted Map and allowance approval
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operational_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | ready
expect: SETUP
submit: run config:show {}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Effective configuration | configuration
expect: openai-codex:gpt-5.5
expect: Reasoning: medium
expect: value hidden
submit: run router:show {"MODEL_TRIAGE_ESCALATION":"openai-codex:gpt-6-luna"}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Configured routing only | routing
expect: operator override
ask: Do the configuration and routing receipts expose the actual selected values and override source without implying authenticated model execution?
submit: run workspace:status {}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 workspace status | workspace
expect: Checkpoints: 0 pending
submit: run threat-model:methodologies {}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Selectable threat model methodologies | methodologies
submit: run engagement:aim {"focus":"evidence handling","engines":["context:build"],"budgetUsd":2.5}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded budget is not enforced | legacy-metadata
expect: no scan work is approved
expect: campaign:study
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: reader-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: reader-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: reader-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: reader-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: reader-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: reader-tail-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: reader-page-40x12
ask: Can the operator read the legacy budget limitation and supported replacement through the existing transcript controls at all six sizes?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-still-needed
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operational_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after
ask: Do all five completed operational actions leave accepted Map, model authorization and investigation work uncreated, with the selected configuration intact?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted
expect: SETUP
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operational_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the need for genuine Map work, with no provider requests, scanner jobs or finding decisions?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
